# WARP-8: a held button's keys. FX held on the kit is the Throws page while it is held: a key fires its throw, and
# FX's release goes back to the page before with nothing left on. GLO held draws its keys
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
expect page Steps
press FX
key w1 down
wait 60
expect page Throws
expect punch_drum >0
shot fx_held.png
key w1 up
wait 40
expect punch_drum 0
key w2 down
wait 40
release FX
wait 40
expect page Steps
expect punch_drum 0
key w2 up
# a tap of FX is still its page
tap FX
wait 40
expect page Character
tap SEQ
# FX held with no key: the Throws page after a moment, and back
press FX
wait 300
expect page Throws
release FX
wait 40
expect page Steps
# GLO held: the mutes' map
press GLO
tapkey b2
wait 300
shot glo_held.png
release GLO
expect page Steps
expect kmute 4
